    },
    "text": {
      "en": "Three things. The bill: Common has a black tip, Arctic is all red. The neck and head: Common has a longer neck and a bigger head, Arctic is round-headed with a short neck. The wings from above: Common has a dark wedge on the outer primaries, Arctic has pale, clean wings with a thin black trailing edge."
